{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/36580","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:42.320879+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"NONE","body":"The bug goes away when you use\n\n```bash\nJAX_USE_SIMPLIFIED_JAXPR_CONSTANTS=True python bug_repro/repro.py\n```\n\nand appears again when `JAX_USE_SIMPLIFIED_JAXPR_CONSTANTS=False`. So maybe this is an issue in the legacy handling of closed-over constants rather than allocation inside the handler. [Current docs](https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/internals/constants.html) say the simplified closed-over-constants path is not yet the default, and that the old path is still used when that flag is off.\n\nFWIW, I was able to reproduce the bug without cudaMalloc using the check_buf.cu file in this [gist](https://gist.github.com/waleed-sh/1ad85e2b931d495ab058c63ce7bf7078). ","created_at":"2026-04-08T19:35:59Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/36580#issuecomment-4209075856","id":4209075856,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/36580","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc764WaQ","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":1,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4209075856/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-04-08T19:35:59Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4209075856","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85965501?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/waleed-sh","id":85965501,"login":"waleed-sh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1OTY1NTAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"Thanks Waleed! I adjusted the issue description and I really appreciate the workaround.","created_at":"2026-04-08T20:15:27Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/36580#issuecomment-4209308204","id":4209308204,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/36580","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc765PIs","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":1,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4209308204/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-04-08T20:15:27Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4209308204","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7417721?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PTNobel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PTNobel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PTNobel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PTNobel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PTNobel","id":7417721,"login":"PTNobel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTc3MjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PTNobel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PTNobel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PTNobel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PTNobel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PTNobel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PTNobel","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Your bug is here:\n```\n    if (const_f64.element_count() > 0) {\n        double v;\n        cudaMemcpy(&v, const_f64.typed_data(), sizeof(double), cudaMemcpyDeviceToHost);\n        if (v <= 0.0 || v >= 1.0)\n            return ffi::Error::InvalidArgument(\"const_f64 corrupted\");\n    }\n```\n\nThe cudaMemcpy is not synchronized with respect to the stream, so it is racy.","created_at":"2026-04-08T20:49:51Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/36580#issuecomment-4209562735","id":4209562735,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/36580","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc766NRv","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4209562735/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-04-08T20:49:51Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4209562735","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nWhen a `jax.ffi.ffi_call` handler calls `cudaMalloc` (or `cudaMallocAsync`),\nclosure-captured float64 constant buffers passed to subsequent FFI calls\nwithin `jax.lax.scan` are zeroed. XLA allocates a new device buffer for the\nconstant but does not initialize it.\n\nConditions (removing any of them makes the problem go away):\n- `jax.ffi.ffi_call` wrapped in `custom_vmap` + `custom_vjp`\n- Two distinct wrapped FFI functions in the same `@jax.jit` scope\n- One called outside `scan`, the other inside `scan`\n- The FFI handler calls `cudaMalloc` or `cudaMallocAsync`\n\nInt64 constant buffers are unaffected — only float64.\n\nI have only tested this on CUDA.\n\n### Repro\n\nSelf-contained repro is at https://github.com/PTNobel/jaxbug :\n\n    cd bug_repro/build\n    cmake .. -DJAXLIB_INC=$(python -c \"import jaxlib; print(jaxlib.__path__[0]+'/include')\")\n    make\n    cd ../..\n    python bug_repro/repro.py\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.9.1\njaxlib: 0.9.1\nnumpy:  2.4.2\npython: 3.13.9 (main, Oct 31 2025, 23:02:44) [Clang 21.1.4 ]\ndevice info: NVIDIA T500-1, 1 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='PTNobel-P15', release='6.19.10-arch1-1', version='#1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 26 Mar 2026 19:20:28 +0000', machine='x86_64')\n\n$ nvidia-smi\nWed Apr  8 00:28:31 2026       \n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| NVIDIA-SMI 595.58.03              Driver Version: 595.58.03      CUDA Version: 13.2     |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n| GPU  Name                 Persistence-M | Bus-Id          Disp.A | Volatile Uncorr. ECC |\n| Fan  Temp   Perf          Pwr:Usage/Cap |           Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  Compute M. |\n|                                         |                        |               MIG M. |\n|=========================================+========================+======================|\n|   0  NVIDIA T500                    Off |   00000000:01:00.0 Off |                  N/A |\n| N/A   50C    P0            N/A  / 5001W |     115MiB /   4096MiB |      4%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |                  N/A |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Processes:                                                                              |\n|  GPU   GI   CI              PID   Type   Process name                        GPU Memory |\n|        ID   ID                                                               Usage      |\n|=========================================================================================|\n|    0   N/A  N/A            2017      G   /usr/bin/gnome-shell                      1MiB |\n|    0   N/A  N/A            2767    C+G   .../lib/xdg-desktop-portal-gnome          3MiB |\n|    0   N/A  N/A            4651    C+G   /usr/bin/kgx                             44MiB |\n|    0   N/A  N/A          338129      C   ...l/.venv/bin/python3         60MiB |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```","closed_at":"2026-04-08T21:02:18Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"htt