_CONSTANTS=False`. So maybe this is an issue in the legacy handling of closed-over constants rather than allocation inside the handler. [Current docs](https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/internals/constants.html) say the simplified closed-over-constants path is not yet the default, and that the old path is still used when that flag is off.\n\nFWIW, I was able to reproduce the bug without cudaMalloc using the check_buf.cu file in this [gist](https://gist.github.com/waleed-sh/1ad85e2b931d495ab058c63ce7bf7078). ","created_at":"2026-04-08T19:35:59Z","event":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/36580#issuecomment-4209075856","id":4209075856,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/36580","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc764WaQ","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":1,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4209075856/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-04-08T19:35:59Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4209075856","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85965501?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/waleed-sh","id":85965501,"login":"waleed-sh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1OTY1NTAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waleed-sh/subscriptions","type":"U